<title>FRANCE: EU raises malt export refund to 37.86 Ecus/T.</title>
<headline>EU raises malt export refund to 37.86 Ecus/T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised the daily refund applying to malt exports to 37.86 Ecus per tonne from 36.43 Ecus, France's grain office said.</p>
<p>The refund, which includes the new monthly increment for December, will apply as of December 1, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
